<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pipeline Zero-Touch: Terraform + Ansible</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #090d16;
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .card {
            background: #131d2e;
            border: 1px solid #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 36px;
            max-width: 650px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #34d399;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
        }
        p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        th, td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        th {
            color: #94a3b8;
            width: 45%;
        }
        td {
            color: #f1f5f9;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="badge">Zero-Touch Automation</div>
        <h1>100% Provisionado e Configurado via Código</h1>
        <p>Infraestrutura provisionada pelo <strong>Terraform</strong> e configuração interna aplicada automaticamente pelo <strong>Ansible</strong> via <code>local-exec</code> em um único comando.</p>
        
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Hostname do Nó:</th>
                <td>{{ ansible_hostname }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Endereço IP Privado:</th>
                <td>{{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Sistema Operacional:</th>
                <td>{{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Memória RAM:</th>
                <td>{{ ansible_memtotal_mb }} MB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Orquestrador de Infra:</th>
                <td>HashiCorp Terraform</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Gerenciador de Config:</th>
                <td>Red Hat Ansible</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Arquitetura / vCPUs:</th>
                <td>{{ ansible_architecture }} ({{ ansible_processor_vcpus }} vCPU)</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="footer">
            FIAP - MBA DevOps & Infrastructure as Code (DVP)
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
